// 271 래칫 막대 이송 전용 키트 — 지렛대 끝 두 폴이 번갈아 톱니 막대를 밀어 막대가 거의 쉬지 않고 곧게 나아간다.
// 설계표: docs/mm507-sheets/271.md. 좌표는 세계 좌표(막대 윗면 높이 1.08 = 틀 윗면). 자세는 t(초)의 절대 함수다.
import * as THREE from 'three';
import { brass, castIron, darkSteel, paint, steel } from '../../models/materials';
import { circlePath, extrude, lathe, mesh, rodProfile, roundedRect, shapeFrom, type V2 } from '../../models/parts/geom';

const DEG = Math.PI / 180;

export const K271 = {
  P: [1.1, 1.62] as [number, number],
  E1: 0.14072,
  E2: 0.14192,
  A1: 120 * DEG,
  A2: -60 * DEG,
  AMP: 25 * DEG,
  T_SWING: 3,
  PERIOD: 10,
  PITCH: 0.12,
  TOOTH_H: 0.07,
  Y_ROOT: 1.2,
  FACE_DEG: 16.8989,
  FACE_DX: 0.02127,
  RT: 0.012,
  YC: 1.21942,
  L1: 1.86016,
  L2: 1.11501,
  G1_REF: 16.8974 * DEG,
  G2_REF: 13.4422 * DEG,
  LIFT: 0.1,
  BAR: [-1.5, 0.76] as [number, number]
} as const;
const K = K271;

const ss = (x: number): number => {
  const t = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, x));
  return t * t * (3 - 2 * t);
};
const posMod = (x: number, m: number): number => ((x % m) + m) % m;

function meshAt(geo: THREE.BufferGeometry, mat: THREE.Material, x: number, y: number, z: number): THREE.Mesh {
  const m = mesh(geo, mat);
  m.position.set(x, y, z);
  return m;
}

/** 깊이 z0 → z1 의 Z 축 원기둥(핀·축) */
function pinZ(r: number, z0: number, z1: number, mat: THREE.Material, c = 0.003): THREE.Mesh {
  const geo = lathe(rodProfile(r, Math.min(z0, z1), Math.max(z0, z1), c, c), 24);
  geo.rotateX(Math.PI / 2);
  return mesh(geo, mat);
}

/** 상자(모서리 둥글림 r, 모따기 c) — x0..x1, y0..y1, z0..z1 */
function box(x0: number, x1: number, y0: number, y1: number, z0: number, z1: number, mat: THREE.Material, r = 0.006, c = 0.004): THREE.Mesh {
  const dz = z1 - z0;
  const rr = Math.min(r, (x1 - x0) / 2 - 0.001, (y1 - y0) / 2 - 0.001);
  const cc = Math.min(c, dz / 2 - 0.0005);
  const m = mesh(extrude(roundedRect(x0, y0, x1, y1, rr), dz, cc), mat);
  m.position.z = (z0 + z1) / 2;
  return m;
}
export { box as box271 };

